  "writing_rules": [
    "A core is a real persistent person identity, never anonymous aggregate headcount.",
    "The referenced cohort owns shared capability, training and routine readiness until an individual component lawfully diverges.",
    "Resolving or narrating a full sheet composes this core with its cohort baseline and only the explicitly referenced individual components.",
    "Routine cohort change updates the cohort owner once and does not fan out writes across person cores.",
    "Materialization, transfer, injury, death or other individual divergence conserves the same person and must preserve the source cohort distribution.",
    "Identity cues constrain characterization but grant no capability, knowledge, relationship, authority, equipment or outcome.",
    "component_refs may add only registered component namespaces whose owners have their own structural authority."
  ]
